<!DOCTYPE html> <html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" lang="pt-BR" xml:lang="pt-BR" xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office"><head> <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8"> <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"> <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="https://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{cbee19c7-84da-4759-aac0-9d3ea9f86b7f}_TemplateFavicon-32x32.png"> <title>Como usuário do Espaço do desenvolvedor Premier, você agora é elegível para participar do Intel&reg;&nbsp;Partner Alliance!​</title> <style>:root {color-scheme: light} @media only screen { html { min-height: 100%;} } /*Eloqua footer overrides*/ .footer_elq {height:auto!important;} .center {background-color:#efefef !important;-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;border: 0px solid #efefef !important;padding-top:10px !important;padding-bottom: 10px !important;} .center p, .center span {color: #262626 !important} .center a, .center strong {color: #0054AE!important} .spacer {visibility:hidden;mso-hide:all;display:none;} @media only screen and (max-width:695px) { .top {display : table-header-group !important ;width : 100% !important ;} .bottom {display : table-footer-group !important ;width : 100% !important ;} .pad-top-24 {padding-top:24px!important} .pad-bottom-24 {padding-bottom:24px!important} .no-mobile-border {border:0!important} .small-text-center {text-align: center!important} .small-text-left {text-align: left!important} .small-text-right {text-align: right!important} .small-float-center {margin: 0 auto!important;float: none!important; text-align: center!important} .mobile-logo {margin: 30px auto!important;} .mobile-logo-left {margin-top: 30px!important; margin-bottom: 30px!important;} table.body center {min-width: 0!important} table.body .container {width: 100%!important}table.body .columns {height: auto!important;-moz-box-sizing: border-box;-webkit-box-sizing: border-box;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 25px!important;padding-right: 25px!important} table.body .collapse .columns { padding-left: 0!important;padding-right: 0!important} th.small-1 {display: inline-block!important;width: 8.33333%!important}th.small-2 {display: inline-block!important;width: 16.66667%!important}th.small-3 {display: inline-block!important; width: 25%!important}th.small-4 {display: inline-block!important;width: 33.33334%!important} th.small-5 {display: inline-block!important;width: 41.66667%!important}th.small-6 {display: inline-block!important;width: 50%!important}th.small-9 {display: inline-block!important;width: 75%!important}th.small-10 {display: inline-block!important;width: 83.33333%!important}th.small-11 {display: inline-block!important;width: 91.66667%!important}th.small-12 {display: inline-block!important;width: 100%!important} .responsive {width: 100%!important;height:auto!important;display: block} .show-for-small {display: block!important;mso-hide: none!important;width: 100%!important} table.show-for-small {display: table!important;width: 100%!important} .show-for-large {display: none!important;width: 0; mso-hide: all;overflow: hidden } table.body .columns.no-padding-mobile {padding-left: 0!important;padding-right: 0!important} th.callout-inner {padding-top: 25px!important;padding-bottom: 25px!important} th.callout-inner-sides {padding-left: 0!important;padding-right: 0!important}} /* Device Styles */ a[x-apple-data-detectors] {color: inherit!important;text-decoration: none!important;font-size: inherit!important;font-family: inherit!important;font-weight: inherit!important;line-height: inherit!important;text-decoration: none!important} span.MsoHyperlink { mso-style-priority: 99; color: inherit;text-decoration: none!important } span.MsoHyperlinkFollowed { mso-style-priority: 99; color: inherit;text-decoration: none!important } #MessageViewBody a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; font-size: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit}</style><!--[if gte mso 9]> <xml> <o:OfficeDocumentSettings> <o:AllowPNG/> <o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch> </o:OfficeDocumentSettings> </xml> <![endif]--> <!--[if gte mso 9]> <style> sup { font-size: 100% !important; } a {text-decoration: none;} /* STYLE OVERRIDES FOR ELOQUA FOOTER */ .center { background-color:#efefef !important; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; border: 0px solid #efefef !important; padding-top:10px !important; padding-bottom: 10px !important;} .center p, .center span {color: #262626 !important} .center a, .center strong {color: #0054AE !important} .spacer {visibility:hidden;mso-hide:all;display:none;} </style> <![endif]--><script>(window.BOOMR_mq=window.BOOMR_mq||[]).push(["addVar",{"rua.upush":"false","rua.cpush":"false","rua.upre":"false","rua.cpre":"false","rua.uprl":"false","rua.cprl":"false","rua.cprf":"false","rua.trans":"","rua.cook":"false","rua.ims":"false","rua.ufprl":"false","rua.cfprl":"false","rua.isuxp":"false","rua.texp":"norulematch"}]);</head> <body style="background:#efefef;-moz-box-sizing:border-box;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;-webkit-box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;box-sizing:border-box;color:#262626;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:400;line-height:24px;margin:0;min-width:100%;padding:0;text-align:left;width:100%!important"><!--START HIDDEN PREHEADER--> <span style="visibility:hidden;mso-hide:all;display:none;"><!-- Preheader text goes here --></span> <!--END PREHEADER--><table role="presentation" bgcolor="#efefef" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="body" valign="top" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th align="center" valign="top" style="padding-top:24px;width:670px;"> <center style="min-width:0!important;width:100%"><!-- BEGIN EMAIL BODY --><table role="presentation" align="center" bgcolor="#262626" border="0" class="container" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="670"> <tbody> <tr> <th><!-- START HEADER --><table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%"> <tr> <th class="small-12 columns pad-bottom-24" style="padding-left:80px;padding-top:40px;text-align:left;width:100%"><img src="https://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{1ea7a4b0-77fb-4bf8-8fca-195a2ccec135}_347x108-Intel-IPA-logo.png" alt="" style="display:block;height:54px;width:174px;" height="54" valign="top" width="174"></th> </tr> </table> <table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th class="small-12 columns" style="padding-left:80px;padding-right:80px;width:510px;"> <table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="middle" width="100%"> <tr> <th class="small-12" style="width:210px;" valign="bottom"> <table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="show-for-large" valign="top" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th style="line-height:24px;font-size:24px;" height="24">&nbsp;</th> </tr> </tbody> </table><img src="https://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{9fe13c0f-6051-4353-9666-41b69885ff6c}_hero_%281%29.jpg" alt="" class="responsive" style="display:block;height:210px;width:210px;" height="210" valign="top" width="210"></th> <th class="small-12 columns" style="background:#000000;width:310px;" valign="middle"> <table role="presentation" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="collapse" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th class="small-12 columns pad-bottom-24 pad-top-24" style="padding:0;padding-bottom:32px;padding-top:32px;padding-left:36px;padding-right:36px;"> <h1 style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:30px;margin:0;margin-bottom:24.5px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Obtenha benefícios extras, além do valor do Espaço do desenvolvedor Premier!</h1><!-- OPTIONAL NON-BUTTON LINK - UNCOMMENT TO USE <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none"> <a href="https://www.intel.com" target="_blank" style="color:#fff;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;"><span style="text-decoration:underline;">Call to action</span><img src="https://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{0230aada-0914-45c2-8d44-ea2c5ae34e04}_arrow_email_white.png" valign="middle" alt=""></a> </p> --><table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%"> <tr> <th style="min-width:200px;"><!-- START BUTTON --><table role="presentation" align="left" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="auto"> <tbody> <tr> <th style="background:#ffffff;padding:10px 24px 10px 24px;"><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/pt/br/secure/forms/ipa-secondary.html" target="_blank" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#006ABB;display:block;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:20px;margin:0;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Inscreva-se no Intel&reg;<br>Partner Alliance<img src="https://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{d10a0171-9566-461e-b39d-83894db2af31}_arrow_email_blue.png" valign="middle" alt=""></a></th> </tr> </tbody> </table><!-- END BUTTON --></th> </tr> </table> </th> </tr> </tbody> </table> </th> </tr> </table> </th> </tr> </tbody> </table><!-- END HEADER --> <!-- START ACCOUNT INFO --><table role="presentation" align="left" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th class="small-12 columns" style="padding-left:80px;padding-right:80px;padding-top:48px;width:510px;"> <table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="collapse" valign="top" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th class="small-12 columns" style="text-align:left;width:255px"> <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:0px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Nome: {!Contact.FirstName}</p> <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:0px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Sobrenome:{!Contact.LastName}</p> <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:0px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Nome de usuário (endereço de e-mail):{!Contact.Email}</p> </th> </tr> </tbody> </table><!-- START SPACER --><table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th style="font-size:32px;line-height:32px;width:100%" height="32"></th> </tr> </tbody> </table><!-- END SPACER --></th> </tr> </tbody> </table><!-- END ACCOUNT INFO --> <!-- START LEFT ALIGNED CONTENT --><table role="presentation" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th class="small-12 columns" style="padding-left:80px;padding-right:80px;padding-bottom:24px;width:510px;"> <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:20px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">O vínculo ao Espaço do desenvolvedor Premier permite acesso a recursos confidenciais da Intel e conteúdo seguro, e agora é um benefício do Intel&reg;&nbsp;Partner Alliance. Como usuário valioso do Espaço do desenvolvedor Premier, você agora é elegível para participar do programa Intel&reg;&nbsp;Partner Alliance imediatamente.</p> <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:20px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Sua empresa já é um membro valioso do Intel&reg;&nbsp;Partner Alliance. Esta é uma oportunidade para você se juntar aos seus colegas que já fazem parte do programa e obter acesso a benefícios exclusivos e extremamente valiosos. Alguns exemplos incluem:</p> <ul style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none"> <li style="list-style:disc outside; mso-special-format:bullet;margin-bottom:20px;">Acesso a mais de 800 cursos de nível mundial e mais de 30 competências e certificações, além de perspectivas do setor e previsões de negócios &mdash; conhecimento vital por meio da <strong>Intel&reg;&nbsp;Partner University</strong>.</li> <li style="list-style:disc outside; mso-special-format:bullet;margin-bottom:20px;">Ganhe <strong>pontos</strong> por meio de compras e atividades de desenvolvimento de negócios elegíveis da Intel. Resgate pontos para necessidades empresariais valiosas.</li> <li style="list-style:disc outside; mso-special-format:bullet;margin-bottom:20px;"><strong>Zonas de ativação</strong> selecionadas, com temas do setor e focadas em tarefas, com recursos para criar, comercializar e vender produtos e soluções com tecnologia Intel&reg;.</li> <li style="list-style:disc outside; mso-special-format:bullet;margin-bottom:20px;">Promova suas soluções no nosso <strong>Intel&reg;&nbsp;Partner Showcase</strong> por meio de sua vitrine personalizada, possibilitando conectar com milhares de parceiros e seus clientes finais em todo o ecossistema.</li> </ul> <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:20px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Inscreva-se agora como um contato e ganhe 100 pontos* para a sua empresa e comece a experimentar tudo o que o Intel&reg;&nbsp;Partner Alliance e o Espaço de desenvolvedor Premier têm a oferecer.</p> <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:20px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Siga estas etapas rápidas e fáceis:</p> <ol style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none"> <li style="margin-bottom:20px;">Clique em <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/pt/br/secure/forms/ipa-secondary.html" target="_blank" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:20px;margin:0;text-align:center;text-decoration:underline;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Inscreva-se já</a> e siga as instruções** para conectar-se à conta da sua empresa.</li> <li style="margin-bottom:20px;">Uma vez confirmado, você receberá um e-mail para fazer login no Intel&reg;&nbsp;Partner Alliance.</li> </ol> <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-bottom:20px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Junte-se ao Intel&reg;&nbsp;Partner Alliance agora e conheça todos os benefícios que o programa&nbsp;oferece.</p> <table role="presentation" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" valign="top" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th style="padding-top:32px;"><!-- START BUTTON --><table role="presentation" align="left" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="auto"> <tbody> <tr> <th style="background:#00C7FD ;padding:10px 24px 10px 24px;"><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/pt/br/secure/forms/ipa-secondary.html" target="_blank" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#262626;display:block;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:20px;margin:0;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Inscreva-se já<img src="https://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{3c6395e2-a99d-4d56-af68-36b36f3ef629}_arrow_email_black.png" valign="middle" alt=""></a></th> </tr> </tbody> </table><!-- END BUTTON --></th> </tr> </tbody> </table><br><p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;margin-top:32px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Precisa de ajuda para se inscrever e se tornar um parceiro? <a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/br/pt/support.html?elqTrackId=e8aebb5fa57546dab808d4902c25087c&elqTrack=true" target="_blank" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:20px;margin:0;text-align:center;text-decoration:underline;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Entre em contato com o&nbsp;suporte</a>.</p><br><p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">*Devem ser pontos elegíveis para se qualificar. Consulte os requisitos de elegibilidade.</p> <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24px;margin-top:20px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none"><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/br/pt/support/articles/000092340/programs/access-entitlement-for-myintel-users.html?wapkw=azure%20mfa%20help&elqTrackId=0f654af1184b4c4a9c97cb0ecda4c3c0&elqTrack=true" target="_blank" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:20px;margin:0;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">*<u>Ajuda da Autenticação Multifator (MFA) do Azure</u></a></p> </th> </tr> </tbody> </table><!-- END LEFT ALIGNED CONTENT --> <!-- START IPA SOCIAL RIBBON - UPDATE THE BACKGROUND COLOR ON THE BLADE BY CHANGING THIS TABLE BACKGROUND --><table role="presentation" align="center" bgcolor="#0095CA" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" valign="top" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th> <table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" valign="middle" width="100%"> <tbody> <tr> <th align="center" style="padding:10px;"> <div style="vertical-align: middle"><img alt="" height="30" src="https://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{04d8272d-eac1-4a18-8060-873796cf5819}_icon_ipa_linkedin.png" style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;" valign="middle" width="39" /> <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/groups/2965079/?elqTrackId=37baac48d4f24cba9407883e64b74cee&elqTrack=true" style="color:#fff;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:30px;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;" target="_blank">Junte-se ao grupo da Intel&reg;&nbsp;Partner Alliance no&nbsp;<span style="text-decoration:underline">LinkedIn</span></a><img alt="" src="https://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{0230aada-0914-45c2-8d44-ea2c5ae34e04}_arrow_email_white.png" style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;" valign="middle" /></div> </th> </tr> </tbody> </table> </th> </tr> </tbody> </table><!-- END IPA SOCIAL RIBBON --> <!-- START SIGNOFF BLADE - UPDATE THE BACKGROUND COLOR ON THE BLADE BY CHANGING THIS TABLE BACKGROUND --><table role="presentation" valign="top" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" bgcolor="#0054AE" align="center"> <tbody> <tr> <th> <center><img align="middle" alt="Conecte-se. Inove. Cresça." class="responsive" height="80" src="https://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{be004823-ae1a-496e-8231-060c2c1fed92}_ipa-signoff-us-en.png" style="-ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic;display:block;outline:0;width:670px;height:80px;" width="670" /></center> </th> </tr> </tbody> </table><!-- END SIGNOFF BLADE --></th> </tr> </tbody> </table><!-- START VIEW IN BROWSER --><table role="presentation" align="center" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="container" width="670"> <tbody> <tr> <th class="small-12 columns" style="width:670px"> <center> </center> </th> </tr> </tbody> </table><!-- END VIEW IN BROWSER --><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="container" width="670"> <tbody> <tr> <th class="small-12 columns" style="padding:0"> <p style="color:#262626;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:20px;margin:0;margin-bottom:24px;padding:0;text-align:center;">&copy; 2024 Intel&nbsp;Corporatio